feat 1.0

# ADR-0027: the negation of a partial value block is ambiguous (which field differs?); refused as MALFORMED_SYNTAX with a hint to negate a field inside the block.

spec SPEC-BAD-020 "Negated value block"
context Bad
aggregate Thing
type command
status draft

construct:
  handler at src/do-thing.ts
  touches src/**

enforce:
  do the thing

contract:
  input ThingInput
  response ThingResult
  record ThingRow

scenario "does the thing":
  when: DoThing { value: 1 }
  predict success:
    response OK ThingResult
    eventStore has [ Wrote with ThingRow { ref: not { id: "x" } } ]
